FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Regarde ça, {{TAG:0005:0008:}} !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Il FAUT que tu voies la lettre que
je viens de recevoir, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Am besten gefällt mir der Anfang.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Bei einem Brief sind die ersten
Sätze total wichtig.
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Der erste Schluck {{TAG:0005:000E:0000}}
schmeckt ja auch immer am
leckersten,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Bu mektubun girişini bayağı sevdim.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Sonuçta mektubun ilk kısmı
en önemli kısım.
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Tıpkı {{TAG:0005:0013:0000}} yemeğinin ilk lokmasının
en lezzetli olması gibi,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}I love the last line of this letter.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}It's really important to get the end
right in a letter.
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}A good last line is like eating
{{TAG:0005:0010:0000}} for dessert,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}J'adore la dernière ligne de cette
lettre.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}} Il est très important de bien
rédiger la dernière ligne d'une lettre.
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Une bonne dernière ligne, c'est
comme {{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0005:0010:0000}}
après un bon repas,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Adoro l'ultima riga di questa lettera.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Del resto è importante cercare di
finire in bellezza!
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Un finale d'impatto è come {{TAG:000E:0002:}}
{{TAG:0005:0010:0000}} per dessert,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Was für ein schöner Schlusssatz!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Wie sagt man so schön:{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Ende gut, alles gut!
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Ein schöner Schluss ist wie
{{TAG:0005:0010:0000}} zum Nachtisch,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Bu mektubun son cümlesine bayıldım.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Mektupta finali iyi bağlamak çok önemli.
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}İyi bir son cümle, tatlı niyetine
{{TAG:0005:0010:0000}} yemek gibi,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

DE:
Übrigens, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}...{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Was hältst du von diesem Brief?{{TAG:0008:0001:0D0000000E0000000F000000}}
Ganz nett.
Na ja...
Lecker!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}It's always nice getting mail, don't
you think?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Anyway, see you later,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Siempre está bien recibir correo,
¿no crees?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Bueno, hasta luego,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Fa sempre piacere ricevere della
posta, vero?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Beh, ora scappo,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Mektup almak hep güzeldir, değil
mi?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Neyse, sonra görüşürüz,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Letters really are a window into
someone's brain, aren't they,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Las cartas son como una ventana
a la mente de alguien, ¿no crees,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Mektuplar insanın beynine açılan pencere
gibi, değil mi,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Oh, is there something particularly
nice in there?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}I'd better reread it,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}İçinde özellikle güzel bir şey mi var?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bir daha okuyayım bari,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ach so, schade...{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Ist wohl einfach nicht dein Stil,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}.

{{TAG:0003:0012:}}„Lecker“?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Wie meinst du das denn?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Der Brief ist nicht aus Esspapier,
falls du das denkst!
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Ach so!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Du meinst, dass der Brief
so lecker nach {{TAG:0005:0013:0000}}
duftet?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0004:}}Stimmt, du hast recht!
